name: sim.getCollisionHandle
description: 
luaSynopsis: int collisionObjectHandle=sim.getCollisionObject(string collisionObjectName)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. collisionObjectName: name of the collision object. If the name is appended by a "@silentError" suffix, then no error will be output if the collision object does not exist.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. handle of collision object or -1 if operation was not successful
